[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2615935602","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102089#issuecomment-2615935602","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102089","id":2615935602,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b7AJy","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T14:37:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T14:37:39Z","body":"Did you try RGBH/RH instead? Using RGB8/R8 means we lose *all* HDR data and have much lower precision, which can be problematic for some use cases.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2615935602/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616583420","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102089#issuecomment-2616583420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102089","id":2616583420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b9eT8","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T18:27:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T18:27:35Z","body":"> Did you try RGBH/RH instead? Using RGB8/R8 means we lose _all_ HDR data and have much lower precision, which can be problematic for some use cases.\r\n\r\n@Calinou Fixed! And it works! And I greatly simplified the code, didn't know that `Image::convert()` existed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616583420/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616755245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102089#issuecomment-2616755245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102089","id":2616755245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b-IQt","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T19:51:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T20:50:45Z","body":"Is this an iOS specific problem? AFAIK RGB32F textures should be supported by all WebGL implementations\r\n\r\n_edit: Just double checked, RGB32F is supported by WebGL 2.0 https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/specs/latest/2.0/. Therefore I suspect this is more a problem of safari on iOS not being compliant with WebGL 2_\r\n\r\n_OOOOhhhh, According to https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebGLRenderingContext/texImage2D  the floating point formats are supported, but may not be texture filterable! Could you test on iOS with the linear filtering disabled? Edit: and that's confirmed by the OpenGL ES 3.0 spec https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/specs/es/3.0/es_spec_3.0.pdf_\r\n\r\nOkay, so, ideally what we would do is check if an implementation supports using the linear filter with a given texture, then convert the texture automatically. This is how we handle compressed textures:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6dc78c8aa17ad46e701e0c4e7b7632c2f0e098f1/drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp#L462-L471\r\n\r\nAnd here is what we did in 3.6 for GLES2 where float textures are only supported with an extension:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d47e2657f23ec38eb47709844096a822261ca145/drivers/gles2/rasterizer_storage_gles2.cpp#L258-L271\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616755245/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616901598","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102089#issuecomment-2616901598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102089","id":2616901598,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b-r_e","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T21:10:51Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T21:20:21Z","body":"I found the missing piece!\r\n\r\nWe need to check if the [`OES_texture_float_linear`](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/OES_texture_float_linear/) extension is supported.\r\n\r\nIt is basically supported everywhere except iOS: https://caniuse.com/?search=OES_texture_float_linear\r\n\r\n_edit: Aaaaaaannd looks like we handled this correctly in 3.x_\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d47e2657f23ec38eb47709844096a822261ca145/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_storage_gles3.cpp#L8190\r\n\r\n\r\nSo, to summarize. We need to add `config.texture_float_linear_supported = config.extensions.has(\"GL_OES_texture_float_linear\"); ` to `config.cpp`. Then we need to check it when creating the texture in `texture_storage.cpp`. If unsupported we can just fall back to RGB16H, i.e:\r\n\r\n\r\nThis: \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6dc78c8aa17ad46e701e0c4e7b7632c2f0e098f1/drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp#L401-L405\r\n\r\nBecomes:\r\n```\r\n case Image::FORMAT_RGBF: { \r\n \tif (config.texture_float_linear_supported) {\r\n \t \tr_gl_internal_format = GL_RGB32F; \r\n \t \tr_gl_format = GL_RGB; \r\n \t \tr_gl_type = GL_FLOAT; \r\n \t} else {\r\n \t \tERR_PRINT(\"RGB32 float texture not supported, converting to RGB16.\"); \r\n \t \tif (image.is_valid()) { \r\n \t \t\timage->convert(Image::FORMAT_RGBH); \r\n \t \t} \r\n \t \tr_real_format = Image::FORMAT_RGBH; \r\n \t \tr_gl_internal_format = GL_RGB16F; \r\n \t \tr_gl_format = GL_RGB; \r\n \t \tr_gl_type = GL_HALF_FLOAT;\r\n \t}\r\n } break; \r\n``` ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616901598/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617409069","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102089#issuecomment-2617409069","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102089","id":2617409069,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cAn4t","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T01:21:24Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T01:21:24Z","body":"@clayjohn It works!\r\n\r\n![IMG_0080](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd0fd043-0967-478f-a912-19ddf7e29a50)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617409069/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619278532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102089#issuecomment-2619278532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102089","id":2619278532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cHwTE","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T15:09:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T15:09:34Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619278532/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]